(BANK TRADE FINANCE COMPLIANCE POLICY ? EXCERPT) Tj
T*
(Version 3.2 | Internal Use Only) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. PROHIBITED TRANSACTIONS) Tj
T*
(   1.1 The Bank will not process any trade finance transaction involving:) Tj
T*
(       a\) Parties, vessels, or countries subject to OFAC, EU, or HMT sanctions) Tj
T*
(       b\) Goods classified as dual-use under EU Regulation 428/2009 without valid export licence) Tj
T*
(       c\) Transactions where the stated purpose cannot be verified by documentation) Tj
T*
(       d\) Advance payment terms for transactions exceeding USD 100,000 to high-risk jurisdictions) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. ENHANCED DUE DILIGENCE \(EDD\) TRIGGERS) Tj
T*
(   2.1 EDD is required when any of the following are present:) Tj
T*
(       a\) Country of origin or discharge port is on the Bank's High-Risk Jurisdiction List) Tj
T*
(       b\) Invoice amount differs from Bill of Lading declared value by more than 10%) Tj
T*
(       c\) Goods description uses generic terms without HS code specification) Tj
T*
(       d\) Transaction involves a free trade zone or special economic zone in a high-risk jurisdiction) Tj
T*
(       e\) Payment terms are cash in advance for amounts exceeding USD 50,000) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. DOCUMENT CONSISTENCY REQUIREMENTS) Tj
T*
(   3.1 The following fields must be consistent across all submitted documents:) Tj
T*
(       a\) Buyer and seller names must match exactly across invoice, B/L, and packing list) Tj
T*
(       b\) Goods description must be consistent across all documents) Tj
T*
(       c\) Declared values must be within 5% across invoice and packing list) Tj
T*
(       d\) Country of origin must be consistent across all documents) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. REPORTING OBLIGATIONS) Tj
T*
(   4.1 A Suspicious Activity Report \(SAR\) must be considered when:) Tj
T*
(       a\) A sanctions hit is confirmed by compliance officer review) Tj
T*
(       b\) Evidence of trade-based money laundering indicators is found) Tj
T*
(       c\) Customer is unable to provide satisfactory explanation for document discrepancies) Tj
T*
ET
